@startuml offering-relationships
title Offering Canonical Relationships ; per CR-ES-021 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O

class "Customer Need" as CN
class "Product" as P
class "Service" as S
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Objective" as Obj
class "Context" as Ctx
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Fulfillment Process" as FP
class "Customer Outcome" as CO
class "Value" as V
class "Escalation Boundary" as EB

O --> CN : addresses
O --> P : composes
O --> S : composes
O --> Cap : exercises
O --> Obj : pursues
O --> Ctx : responds-to
O --> Auth : operates-within
O --> Pol : governed-by
O --> Con : constrained-by
O --> FP : fulfilled-through
O --> CO : produces
O --> V : realizes
O --> EB : escalates-through

note bottom of O
  No foundational concept silently introduced per CR-ES-021 section 7.
  Deferred concepts per ADR-ES-021 section 12.
end note

@enduml
